Welcome to your new Arch Linux system! If you are not on the newly installed
system (you should have received a warning if that is the case), shut off the
computer, disconnect any boot media and turn on the computer again.

Otherwise, we can now make additional steps toward a more fully fleshed out
setup. The first couple of these will deal with security. We will install ufw,
a simple firewall, and set up a very basic rule set for it. Afterwards, we can
get onto the much more daunting task of installing Secure Boot.
